{"4146710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oh Puck!", "steam_appid": 4146710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/304a937a53abaa11c6822a9138b9777d.webp?t=1777559978\" width=300 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>up to 4 players</strong>, either locally or through <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>. Slide your puck across the rink to score. Every match is fast, unpredictable, and hilariously tense until the very last puck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/77b12f8bef780600ecb196a1fc7dcadb.poster.avif?t=1777559978\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/77b12f8bef780600ecb196a1fc7dcadb.webm?t=1777559978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/c5068e43a21a48f43bf167011f42e62a.webp?t=1777559978\" width=300 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a variety of special pucks: magnetic pucks that attract your opponents’ shots, golden pucks with extra scoring power, capturing pucks that steal control, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/c76cb364d62a4d83907269e010ea1409.poster.avif?t=1777559978\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/c76cb364d62a4d83907269e010ea1409.webm?t=1777559978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/a9079973a0f65a0bca723e0483c47326.webp?t=1777559978\" width=300 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t just compete, sabotage your rivals! Steal, block, redirect, and outmaneuver them with skillful plays. Chaos is your best friend when the puck counts and every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/6e43863ee8dea19334a0a726fc225fad.poster.avif?t=1777559978\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/6e43863ee8dea19334a0a726fc225fad.webm?t=1777559978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/7a273247335364a418f4d57070cc9f40.webp?t=1777559978\" width=300 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it’s classic head-to-heads or fast-paced party brawls, <i>Oh Puck!</i> offers multiple match modes to keep every session fresh. Mix up your playstyle and keep your opponents guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/f9d2e5f6810bbfe69dde4b244b266db8.poster.avif?t=1777559978\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/f9d2e5f6810bbfe69dde4b244b266db8.webm?t=1777559978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/304a937a53abaa11c6822a9138b9777d.webp?t=1777559978\" width=300 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>up to 4 players</strong>, either locally or through <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>. Slide your puck across the rink to score. Every match is fast, unpredictable, and hilariously tense until the very last puck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/77b12f8bef780600ecb196a1fc7dcadb.poster.avif?t=1777559978\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/77b12f8bef780600ecb196a1fc7dcadb.webm?t=1777559978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/c5068e43a21a48f43bf167011f42e62a.webp?t=1777559978\" width=300 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a variety of special pucks: magnetic pucks that attract your opponents’ shots, golden pucks with extra scoring power, capturing pucks that steal control, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/c76cb364d62a4d83907269e010ea1409.poster.avif?t=1777559978\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/c76cb364d62a4d83907269e010ea1409.webm?t=1777559978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/a9079973a0f65a0bca723e0483c47326.webp?t=1777559978\" width=300 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t just compete, sabotage your rivals! Steal, block, redirect, and outmaneuver them with skillful plays. Chaos is your best friend when the puck counts and every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/6e43863ee8dea19334a0a726fc225fad.poster.avif?t=1777559978\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/6e43863ee8dea19334a0a726fc225fad.webm?t=1777559978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146710/extras/7a273247335364a418f4d57070cc9f40.webp?t=1777559978\" width=300 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it’s classic head-to-heads or fast-paced party brawls, <i>Oh Puck!</i> offers multiple match modes to keep every session fresh. Mix up your playstyle and keep your opponents guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\"